Mettaton is a unique monster that can only take a little amount of DMG each time, referencing his massive amount of DEF in Undertale. He started out as a 2/5 for 6G that could only take 1 DMG at a time. '''Alpha 2.1''' gave him -1 HP (to 4), but '''Alpha 3.2''' reverted this, bringing him back to start.
[[File:5.3 Mettaton.png|thumb|244x244px|Beta 5.3]]
He stayed like this until '''Beta 4.2''', where he actually got +1 HP (to 6). This was followed up by -1 cost in both '''Beta 4.6''' and '''Beta 5.2''', down to 4G. This was deemed too powerful, so the next update, '''Beta 5.3''', gave him -1 HP again, bringing him back to start again, 2/5, but now with -2 cost of 4G instead of 6G.
[[File:Mettaton (Beta 22.0).png|thumb|245x245px|Beta 22.0]]
This stayed all the way until '''Beta 22.0''', where his ATK was dropped for the first time, to/by 1. '''Beta 36.1''' followed that with another -1 HP. '''Beta 43.0''' gave him back +1/+1 as well as -1 cost, reducing it to an even lower 3G and bringing his other stats back to the starting 2/5 yet again. But this came at a cost of a huge first effect nerf. Instead of reducing any DMG taken to 1, it's now reduced to 3.
[[File:Mettaton (Beta 36.1).png|thumb|250x250px|Beta 36.1]]

